# AI-Based Hard Hat Detection using YOLOv11

## Overview

This project implements a real-time **Hard Hat Detection System** using **YOLOv11** to identify construction workers wearing safety helmets. The system is trained on the Hard Hat Detection dataset from Kaggle and can detect three object classes: **Helmet**, **Head**, and **Person**.

The project demonstrates an end-to-end object detection pipeline, including dataset preprocessing, annotation conversion, model training, evaluation, and inference.

---

## Features

* Object detection using YOLOv11
* Pascal VOC XML to YOLO annotation conversion
* Automatic train, validation, and test dataset splitting
* Transfer learning using pretrained YOLOv11 weights
* Detection on images
* Model evaluation using standard object detection metrics

---

## Dataset

**Dataset:** Hard Hat Detection

**Source:** https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/andrewmvd/hard-hat-detection

### Classes

* Helmet
* Head
* Person

